<title>USA: LILCO Q3 shr declines to $0.97.</title>
<headline>LILCO Q3 shr declines to $0.97.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.97		    $0.99</p>
<p> Earnings for	   116,972		  118,069</p>
<p>common stock</p>
<p> Revs		     849,775		  875,794</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,495		  119,370</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.77		    $1.71</p>
<p> Earnings for	   213,110		  203,417</p>
<p>common stock</p>
<p> Revs		   2,408,592		2,320,806</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,220		  119,042</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Long Island Lighting Co</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings declined in 3Q 1996 due to the timing of recognition of revenues and expenses related to gas business growth. LILCO also said earnings in first nine months 1996 were boosted by gas business results. Gas had higher sales due to growth of space heating customers, colder weather, higher off-system sales and a December 1, 1995 rate increase.</p>
